      "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Recipe\",\"name\":\"Parmesan Chive Mashed Potatoes\",\"description\":\"Creamy, buttery Yukon Gold mashed potatoes folded with Parmesan and topped with fresh chives. A holiday side dish that steals the show.\",\"image\":[\"https://briansunter.com/kitchen.jpg\"],\"recipeIngredient\":[\"5 Yukon Gold potatoes\",\"¼ cup butter\",\"¼ cup heavy cream\",\"1 teaspoon salt\",\"¼ cup Parmesan cheese\",\"chopped chives\"],\"recipeInstructions\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Step 1\",\"url\":\"https://briansunter.com/recipes/parmesan-chive-mashed-potatoes#step-1\",\"image\":\"https://briansunter.com/kitchen.jpg\",\"text\":\"Peel and cut  5 Yukon Gold potatoes  into even chunks. Boil in salted water until tender,  15 minutes .\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Step 2\",\"url\":\"https://briansunter.com/recipes/parmesan-chive-mashed-potatoes#step-2\",\"image\":\"https://briansunter.com/kitchen.jpg\",\"text\":\"Drain well and return to the  pot .\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Step 3\",\"url\":\"https://briansunter.com/recipes/parmesan-chive-mashed-potatoes#step-3\",\"image\":\"https://briansunter.com/kitchen.jpg\",\"text\":\"Roughly mash the potatoes until smooth. Add  ¼ cup butter ,  ¼ cup heavy cream , and  1 teaspoon salt . Mash until super soft and creamy.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"name\":\"Step 4\",\"url\":\"https://briansunter.com/recipes/parmesan-chive-mashed-potatoes#step-4\",\"image\":\"https://briansunter.com/kitchen.jpg\",\"text\":\"Fold in  ¼ cup Parmesan cheese  for extra flavor. Sprinkle with  chopped chives  and serve.\"}],\"recipeCuisine\":[\"American\"],\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Brian Sunter\"},\"keywords\":\"american, potato, side-dish, vegetarian, holiday, quick\",\"recipeYield\":\"4\",\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"pot\"}],\"cookTime\":\"PT15M\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.5\",\"ratingCount\":\"1\",\"bestRating\":\"5\",\"worstRating\":\"1\"},\"nutrition\":{\"@type\":\"NutritionInformation\",\"calories\":\"467\",\"proteinContent\":\"9g\",\"carbohydrateContent\":\"66g\",\"fatContent\":\"19g\",\"fiberContent\":\"6g\"}}"
